COMPILATION OF: E52PJ

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E52PJ

   1 a 0000 E52PJ: procedure options(main);
   2 a 0006    /* E52PJ (picture operand p'9.9': b2 discriminator vs comma;
   3 a 0006       HC=HD=01; IF b2=00 the COMMA is a designator; scale
   4 a 0006       mismatch vs d(4,2) may refuse (classified either way)) */
   5 a 0006    /* P3-3 decimal family: d fixed decimal(4,2) mirrors LOAN2's yi;
   6 a 0006       the picture operand under test is the ONE varying element. */
   7 c 0006    dcl d fixed decimal(4,2);
   8 c 0006    put edit(d)(p'9.9');
   9 a 002A end E52PJ;

CODE SIZE = 002D
DATA AREA = 000D
FREE SYMS = 38D4
END  COMPILATION
